0..74 Comment "// The group laws of `../../model/identity/group-laws.gandr` with the left"
75..143 Comment "// inverse added: `mul(inv(x), x) ==> e()` overlaps associativity at"
144..216 Comment "// `mul(mul(inv(x), x), z)`, which it leaves at `z` and associativity at"
217..290 Comment "// `mul(inv(x), mul(x, z))`, a term no rule rewrites. The pair joins only"
291..368 Comment "// through the cell completion derives, `mul(inv(x), mul(x, y)) ==> y`, which"
369..442 Comment "// follows from the written rules; the check declines derived cells today"
443..478 Comment "// (#338), so the block is refused."
